<TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 21pt">&#9679;</TD><TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Revenues
